abstract: "ClassicalGuitarOntology v1.6.0 is the frozen OWL 2 DL release representing all six curriculum levels of classical guitar education. The public release includes the authoritative OWL baseline, a separately validated SWRL supplement, compact formal-validation evidence, and representative reasoning documentation. Detailed validation, competency-question, provenance, traceability, and integrity records are retained as part of the study documentation."
